      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おいおい、親切に全部教えてくれたぞ。\r\nコイツの口にこそ、\r\n鍵をかけた方がいいんじゃないか？",
        "official_en": "Not that I’m complaining but... Not sure why they gave an important key to the guy with the largest mouth in the military...",
        "real_en": "Well, he just told us everything. Maybe it's his mouth that needs locking up!"
      },
      "review": {
