      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この鍵はマスターキーと言ってな。\r\nすべての地下牢の扉を開けられるんだ！\r\nだから、ぜっっったいに渡すわけにはいかーん！",
        "official_en": "I can’t let them know that this key opens every door in the dungeon, including Prince Shera’s cell...so there’s no way in hell I’ll let them get their grubby little hands on it!",
        "real_en": "This is the master key! It opens every cell door in the dungeon! That's why I'm neeeever handing it over!"
      },
